 </span><span begin="01:01.970" end="01:02.750">face </span><span begin="01:02.750" end="01:03.260">like </span><span begin="01:03.260" end="01:04.340">me</span><span begin="01:04.340" end="01:10.490">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.490" end="01:12.230"><span begin="01:10.490" end="01:10.820">And </span><span begin="01:10.820" end="01:11.030">all </span><span begin="01:11.030" end="01:11.150">the </span><span begin="01:11.150" end="01:11.630">people </span><span begin="01:11.630" end="01:12.230">say</span><span begin="01:12.230" end="01:12.230">:</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.230" end="01:15.800"><span begin="01:12.230" end="01:12.260">"</span><span begin="01:12.260" end="01:12.590">You </span><span begin="01:12.590" end="01:13.220">can't </span><span begin="01:13.220" end="01:13.790">wake </span><span begin="01:13.790" end="01:14.240">up</span><span begin="01:14.240" end="01:14.240">, </span><span begin="01:14.240" end="01:14.540">this </span><span begin="01:14.540" end="01:14.750">is </span><span begin="01:14.750" end="01:15.050">not </span><span begin="01:15.050" end="01:15.110">a </span><span begin="01:15.110" end="01:15.800">dream</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.950" end="01:19.730"><span begin="01:15.950" end="01:16.160">You're </span><span begin="01:16.160" end="01:16.580">part </span><span begin="01:16.580" end="01:16.820">of </span><span begin="01:16.820" end="01:16.940">a </span><span begin="01:16.940" end="01:17.750">machine</span><span begin="01:17.750" end="01:17.750">, </span><span begin="01:17.750" end="01:18.020">you </span><span begin="01:18.020" end="01:18.170">are </span><span begin="01:18.170" end="01:18.560">not </span><span begin="01:18.560" end="01:18.650">a </span><span begin="01:18.650" end="01:19.220">human </span><span begin="01:19.220" end="01:19.730">being</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.730" end="01:23.870"><span begin="01:19.730" end="01:20.000">With </span><span begin="01:20.000" end="01:20.120"